  data: {
    LLM: 'Save your 8s until you are stuck with a single card and no matching suit. Use Aces to skip opponents who only have 1 or 2 cards left.\n\nSuit Control: If you have many Hearts, use an 8 to change the suit to Hearts, forcing others to draw until they find matching cards.\n\nObservation: Watch which suits your opponents are drawing for. If an opponent draws multiple times, they are likely void in the current suitâ€”prevent them from changing it.',
